# ---- C++ / CMake build trees -------------------------------------------------
# Added with the cpp/ port. Without these, a CMake build tree puts ~76 regenerable
# files in `git status` -- which buries the handful of real source files and makes
# `git clean -fd` (the natural reflex in a repo that looks full of artefacts) delete
# the port along with the objects, because git cannot tell them apart.
build/
build-*/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
install_manifest.txt
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
compile_commands.json
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.so.*

# ---- Models / weights (fetched or exported out-of-band) ----------------------
*.onnx
*.engine
*.plan
